 game you’re going to pass off to your friends and say, “You’ve gotta check this out.” It’s dangerously addictive.\" - IGN 9/10\n\n\"One of the best mobile gaming experiences I've had this year.\" - Destructoid, 10/10\n\n\"Knows exactly what type of game it wants to be and executes on it spectacularly. Merciless difficulty meets brilliant design.\" - Gamezebo, 5/5", "bundleId": "com.distractionware.superhexagon", "userRatingCount": 513}]}